From: AIM upstream (Apache-2.0)
Subject: Retain Linux stream-connect state and pass inherited sockets directly

Backports to 9b5068fa8185d3f51f1862fe7c54d88d51f09ec8:
https://github.com/hahnlee/aim/commit/1a203861883b79edd91869a711fa96d857229df1
