The stream helpers are retained from upstream source at
934009283f69c251f57ed95ef1dff296546bb6ad. The descriptor exporter keeps
its original receipt path for recorded sockets and its existing plain
descriptor path for sockets recognized without a sockfs allocation.
Original APIs, inode allocation checks and socket adoption remain intact.

